note The rows. rows_window turns the scroll offset into the first visible line and emits the spacer for the lines above; then one code block of the visible lines, then a spacer for the rest plus a row of slack, so the scrollbar sees the whole file while only what shows is drawn. The bar closure marks the selected tour's anchors in this file, the background closure the selected lines.

