file crates/gui/src/views/center.rs
symbol source
lines 14 31
hash b45cba7d4cbc5ee7
note A pending scroll: anything that selected a symbol or opened a line left a LineRequest in Nav, and it becomes a scroll offset three rows above that line, clamped to the file. The viewport height comes from what the column measured last frame. The request carries a ticket, and ScrolledToLine clears it only if no newer request replaced it meanwhile.
